---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero__inner">
    <div>
      <p class="label">Founder-led software studio</p>
      <h1>We design and build <em>our own software.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero__lead">Meridion Systems picks a problem worth solving, designs the product, builds it end to end, and keeps improving it with the people who use it.</p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/products/">See our products →</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/about/">How we work</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="hero__facts">
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4.5" y="1.5" width="7" height="13" rx="1.5"/><path d="M7 12.5h2"/></svg>Kyntra, our first product, is in private testing</li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="5.5" r="2.5"/><path d="M3 14c.5-3 2.5-4 5-4s4.5 1 5 4"/></svg>Founder-led: the person who designs it also builds it</li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 1.5l5.5 2v4c0 3.2-2.3 5.7-5.5 7-3.2-1.3-5.5-3.8-5.5-7v-4z"/><path d="M5.5 8l2 2 3-3.5"/></svg>Tested, accessible and honest about what's done</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="stack-visual" role="img" aria-label="Five layers showing how a product moves through the studio: scope, design, build, test with people, release">
      <div class="stack" aria-hidden="true"><div class="stack__scene">
        <div class="layer layer--1"><span class="layer__num">01</span><span><span class="layer__name">Scope</span><br><span class="layer__info">Problem, people, limits</span></span></div>
        <div class="layer layer--2"><span class="layer__num">02</span><span><span class="layer__name">Design</span><br><span class="layer__info">Screens and data model</span></span></div>
        <div class="layer layer--3"><span class="layer__num">03</span><span><span class="layer__name">Build</span><br><span class="layer__info">Small steps, tested</span></span></div>
        <div class="layer layer--4"><span class="layer__num">04</span><span><span class="layer__name">Test with people</span><br><span class="layer__info">Private testing</span></span></div>
        <div class="layer layer--5"><span class="layer__num">05</span><span><span class="layer__name">Release</span><br><span class="layer__info">Then keep improving</span></span></div>
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt" aria-labelledby="studio-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="label">The studio</p>
      <h2 class="heading" id="studio-heading">Small on purpose</h2>
      <p class="sub">No client work and no agency layers. One studio making a few products properly.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Product-focused</h3>
        <p>We start from a specific problem and the people who have it. A feature earns its place by making the product easier to use.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c.7-4.5 4-6.5 8-6.5s7.3 2 8 6.5"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Founder-led</h3>
        <p>The founder sets direction and writes code. Decisions don't get lost between handoffs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.5l8 3v6c0 5-3.3 8.5-8 10-4.7-1.5-8-5-8-10v-6z"/><path d="M8.5 12l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Engineering quality</h3>
        <p>Automated tests, continuous integration and careful handling of data from the first commit. Privacy is decided in the design.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="products-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="label">Products</p>
      <h2 class="heading" id="products-heading">What we're building</h2>
      <p class="sub">Nothing here has launched. Each product shows where it really stands.</p>
    </div>
    {% include "product-list.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

{% include "cta.njk" %}
